  "content": "<p>这个模组在海洋中添加了一艘<strong>巨型村民战舰</strong>，满载村民和珍贵货物。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/92/ship.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/99/forge.png\" width=\"385\"></p><ul>\n<li><strong>生成位置：</strong>这艘船会出现在所有<strong>海洋生物群系</strong>中。</li>\n<li><strong>村民船员：</strong>战舰由各种职业的村民操控，并有铁傀儡保护船上的宝藏。</li>\n</ul><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/94/inside-captain-rooms.png\" width=\"385\"><img style=\"float:right\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/95/iron-golem-building-room.png\" width=\"385\"></p><p>这艘船隐藏着许多待发现的秘密，并拥有装饰精美的内部空间。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/1311/97/ship-side.png\"></p><hr><p>欢迎在您的整合包中使用此模组</p><hr><p style=\"text-align:center\">也请查看灾厄村民战舰模组：</p><p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/951/264/illager-warship.png\" width=\"385\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#3598db\"><a style=\"color:#3598db\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-warship\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/illager-warship</a></span></p>",
